              "            </td>\n",
              "            <td style=\"font-size: 1.1em;\">sadly, i choose to ignore the other postings about this being a very large helmut. my four year old was totally smitten once he saw the photograph of this and he was so excited to get it. it is HUGE. absolutely, unbearably huge. causes much frustration and sadness in my son. it is big on his dad. i tried to fit it with foam strips but that didn't work. it is just that huge. also, the price? really?</td>\n",
